{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261103%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E6%B6%89%E5%81%A5%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E6%9B%B4%E8%A1%A3%E5%AE%A4%E9%9D%9E%E7%A6%AE%E5%8F%8A%E7%AA%BA%E6%B7%AB-%E5%A0%B1%E7%A8%B1%E4%BB%BB%E8%81%B7%E7%8D%B8%E9%86%AB%E7%94%B7%E8%AD%B7%E7%8D%B2%E6%92%A4%E7%AA%BA%E6%B7%AB%E7%BD%AA-%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E7%BD%AA%E6%8A%BC%E5%BE%8C%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B41.12%E5%86%8D%E8%A8%8A-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>報稱任獸醫護士的35歲男子，被指今年3月在尖沙咀九龍中心24/7 Fitness非禮及窺淫另一男子，被控兩罪，案件今（3日）在九龍城裁判法院再提堂。被告面對的一項窺淫罪獲撤控，控方繼續起訴其非禮罪，案件押後至明年1月12日再訊，被告續准以1,000元保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告蘇啟浩（35歲，報稱獸醫護士）被控於今年3月24日，在尖沙咀亞士厘道29號至39號九龍中心1樓24/7 Fitness更衣室內猥褻侵犯另一人，即男子X。</p>\n<p>他另面對一項窺淫罪，今獲控方撤控。控罪指稱，他於同日同地，暗中為了性目的而觀察男子X，而X處於令人對保存私隱有合理期望的情況，被告不理會X是否同意被他觀察。</p>\n<p>法院：九龍城裁判法院<br/>法官：裁判官余俊翔<br/>被告：蘇啟浩<br/>控罪：非禮、窺淫<br/>案件編號：KCCC1380/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:16.233274+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:47:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.604167+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:20.094711+00:00","content_hash":"6c372d60936aa99bb4f4b5bc032b508d8cea1ba59139547bf37fad39e9d8180a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}